# The workspace's one PlantUML renderer, fetched by `uv run poe fetch-plantuml` at the
# version `vendor/plantuml/pin.toml` names. The PIN is committed and the jar is not: it is
# ~30 MB, this repository already carries 49.9 MB of jar blobs in its history from the two
# it used to vendor, and a fetched-and-checksummed file is the same bytes for everyone.
vendor/plantuml/*.jar

# `bazel build` in packages/sphinx-mounts/tests/example writes these convenience symlinks
# into the workspace; the root pytest `norecursedirs` skips them for the same reason
